---
import MainLayout from '../layouts/MainLayout.astro';
---

<MainLayout title="About Us">
  <div class="about-hero">
    <div class="container">
      <h1>About AstroFly Robotics</h1>
      <p class="tagline">Revolutionizing industries through intelligent aerial technology</p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <section class="section">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="about-grid">
        <div class="about-content">
          <h2>Our Story</h2>
          <p>
            AstroFly Robotics was founded by a team of aerospace engineers and AI specialists with a shared vision: to revolutionize how businesses approach security and industrial automation through advanced drone technology.
          </p>
          <p>
            What began as a research project on autonomous flight systems has evolved into a cutting-edge technology company at the forefront of aerial robotics. Our team combines expertise in artificial intelligence, machine vision, sensor technology, and enterprise software integration to deliver comprehensive drone solutions that address real-world challenges.
          </p>
          <p>
            Today, AstroFly Robotics stands as an industry leader, partnering with businesses around the world to enhance their security capabilities, streamline manufacturing processes, and optimize logistics operations through intelligent aerial systems.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="about-image">
          <img src="/images/about-company.jpg" alt="AstroFly Robotics Office" onerror="this.src='/images/placeholder.jpg'">
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="vision-mission">
        <div class="vision">
          <h2>Our Vision</h2>
          <p>
            To create a world where autonomous aerial systems enhance human capabilities, making businesses safer, more efficient, and more responsive to challenges.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="mission">
          <h2>Our Mission</h2>
          <p>
            To develop and deploy intelligent drone solutions that solve critical security and industrial challenges while setting new standards for autonomous operation, data analytics, and enterprise integration.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="our-tech">
        <h2>Our Technology</h2>
        <div class="tech-grid">
          <div class="tech-card">
            <div class="tech-icon">
              <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="48" height="48" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
                <circle cx="12" cy="12" r="3"></circle>
                <path d="M19.4 15a1.65 1.65 0 0 0 .33 1.82l.06.06a2 2 0 0 1 0 2.83 2 2 0 0 1-2.83 0l-.06-.06a1.65 1.65 0 0 0-1.82-.33 1.65 1.65 0 0 0-1 1.51V21a2 2 0 0 1-2 2 2 2 0 0 1-2-2v-.09A1.65 1.65 0 0 0 9 19.4a1.65 1.65 0 0 0-1.82.33l-.06.06a2 2 0 0 1-2.83 0 2 2 0 0 1 0-2.83l.06-.06a1.65 1.65 0 0 0 .33-1.82 1.65 1.65 0 0 0-1.51-1H3a2 2 0 0 1-2-2 2 2 0 0 1 2-2h.09A1.65 1.65 0 0 0 4.6 9a1.65 1.65 0 0 0-.33-1.82l-.06-.06a2 2 0 0 1 0-2.83 2 2 0 0 1 2.83 0l.06.06a1.65 1.65 0 0 0 1.82.33H9a1.65 1.65 0 0 0 1-1.51V3a2 2 0 0 1 2-2 2 2 0 0 1 2 2v.09a1.65 1.65 0 0 0 1 1.51 1.65 1.65 0 0 0 1.82-.33l.06-.06a2 2 0 0 1 2.83 0 2 2 0 0 1 0 2.83l-.06.06a1.65 1.65 0 0 0-.33 1.82V9a1.65 1.65 0 0 0 1.51 1H21a2 2 0 0 1 2 2 2 2 0 0 1-2 2h-.09a1.65 1.65 0 0 0-1.51 1z"></path>
              </svg>
            </div>
            <h3>Advanced AI Systems</h3>
            <p>
              Our proprietary machine learning algorithms enable our drones to analyze visual and sensor data in real-time, detecting anomalies, tracking movement, and making autonomous decisions based on environmental conditions.
            </p>
          </div>

          <div class="tech-card">
            <div class="tech-icon">
              <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="48" height="48" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
                <polygon points="12 2 2 7 12 12 22 7 12 2"></polygon>
                <polyline points="2 17 12 22 22 17"></polyline>
                <polyline points="2 12 12 17 22 12"></polyline>
              </svg>
            </div>
            <h3>Multi-Spectral Sensing</h3>
            <p>
              Combining optical, thermal, infrared, and LiDAR technologies, our drones can "see" beyond human capabilities, functioning in low-light conditions, detecting heat signatures, and creating precise 3D maps of their surroundings.
            </p>
          </div>

          <div class="tech-card">
            <div class="tech-icon">
              <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="48" height="48" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
                <path d="M9 19c-5 1.5-5-2.5-7-3m14 6v-3.87a3.37 3.37 0 0 0-.94-2.61c3.14-.35 6.44-1.54 6.44-7A5.44 5.44 0 0 0 20 4.77 5.07 5.07 0 0 0 19.91 1S18.73.65 16 2.48a13.38 13.38 0 0 0-7 0C6.27.65 5.09 1 5.09 1A5.07 5.07 0 0 0 5 4.77a5.44 5.44 0 0 0-1.5 3.78c0 5.42 3.3 6.61 6.44 7A3.37 3.37 0 0 0 9 18.13V22"></path>
              </svg>
            </div>
            <h3>Enterprise Integration</h3>
            <p>
              Our systems connect seamlessly with existing enterprise software through secure APIs and SDKs, ensuring that drone data flows directly into your security, manufacturing, or logistics management platforms.
            </p>
          </div>

          <div class="tech-card">
            <div class="tech-icon">
              <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="48" height="48" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
                <path d="M20.24 12.24a6 6 0 0 0-8.49-8.49L5 10.5V19h8.5z"></path>
                <line x1="16" y1="8" x2="2" y2="22"></line>
                <line x1="17.5" y1="15" x2="9" y2="15"></line>
              </svg>
            </div>
            <h3>Aerospace Engineering</h3>
            <p>
              Built with lightweight yet durable materials and aerodynamic designs, our drones maximize flight time while ensuring stability in challenging weather conditions and environments.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="our-team">
        <h2>Our Team</h2>
        <p class="team-intro">
          Led by industry pioneers with backgrounds in aerospace engineering, artificial intelligence, and enterprise software development, our diverse team combines decades of experience with a passion for innovation.
        </p>
        <div class="team-grid">
          <div class="team-member">
            <div class="member-image">
              <img src="/images/team/ceo.jpg" alt="CEO of AstroFly Robotics" onerror="this.src='/images/placeholder.jpg'">
            </div>
            <h3>Dr. Amelia Chen</h3>
            <p class="member-title">Founder & CEO</p>
            <p class="member-bio">
              Former lead engineer at NASA's Jet Propulsion Laboratory with a PhD in Aerospace Engineering and 15+ years of experience in autonomous flight systems.
            </p>
          </div>

          <div class="team-member">
            <div class="member-image">
              <img src="/images/team/cto.jpg" alt="CTO of AstroFly Robotics" onerror="this.src='/images/placeholder.jpg'">
            </div>
            <h3>Michael Rodriguez</h3>
            <p class="member-title">Chief Technology Officer</p>
            <p class="member-bio">
              AI specialist with a background in computer vision and machine learning. Previously led development of autonomous systems at leading tech companies.
            </p>
          </div>

          <div class="team-member">
            <div class="member-image">
              <img src="/images/team/cso.jpg" alt="CSO of AstroFly Robotics" onerror="this.src='/images/placeholder.jpg'">
            </div>
            <h3>Sarah Nakamura</h3>
            <p class="member-title">Chief Strategy Officer</p>
            <p class="member-bio">
              Former security consultant with expertise in integrating technology solutions in high-risk environments across government and private sectors.
            </p>
          </div>

          <div class="team-member">
            <div class="member-image">
              <img src="/images/team/cpo.jpg" alt="CPO of AstroFly Robotics" onerror="this.src='/images/placeholder.jpg'">
            </div>
            <h3>James Nguyen</h3>
            <p class="member-title">Chief Product Officer</p>
            <p class="member-bio">
              Product development expert with a track record of bringing innovative hardware and software solutions to market in the enterprise technology space.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="our-impact">
        <h2>Our Impact</h2>
        <div class="impact-grid">
          <div class="impact-card">
            <div class="impact-icon">
              <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="48" height="48" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
                <path d="M22 11.08V12a10 10 0 1 1-5.93-9.14"></path>
                <polyline points="22 4 12 14.01 9 11.01"></polyline>
              </svg>
            </div>
            <h3>Enhanced Security</h3>
            <p>
              Our drones have helped organizations reduce security incidents by up to 75% through continuous surveillance and rapid response capabilities.
            </p>
          </div>

          <div class="impact-card">
            <div class="impact-icon">
              <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="48" height="48" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
                <path d="M21.21 15.89A10 10 0 1 1 8 2.83"></path>
                <path d="M22 12A10 10 0 0 0 12 2v10z"></path>
              </svg>
            </div>
            <h3>Operational Efficiency</h3>
            <p>
              Manufacturing clients report an average of 30% reduction in inspection time and a 45% increase in defect detection through our drone monitoring systems.
            </p>
          </div>

          <div class="impact-card">
            <div class="impact-icon">
              <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="48" height="48" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
                <path d="M3 3l7.07 16.97 2.51-7.39 7.39-2.51L3 3z"></path>
                <path d="M13 13l6 6"></path>
              </svg>
            </div>
            <h3>Workplace Safety</h3>
            <p>
              By deploying drones for hazardous inspection tasks, our clients have achieved a significant reduction in workplace accidents and exposure to dangerous environments.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section section-dark cta-section">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="cta-content">
        <h2>Join the Aerial Revolution</h2>
        <p>Discover how AstroFly's drone technology can transform your operations</p>
        <div class="cta-buttons">
          <a href="/contact" class="button button-accent">Contact Our Team</a>
          <a href="/products" class="button button-secondary">Explore Our Products</a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</MainLayout>

<style>
  .about-hero {
    background: var(--gradient-primary);
    color: white;
    padding: var(--space-xl) 0;
    text-align: center;
  }
  
  .about-hero h1 {
    color: white;
    font-size: 3rem;
    margin-bottom: var(--space-sm);
  }
  
  .tagline {
    font-size: 1.5rem;
    opacity: 0.9;
  }
  
  /* About Grid */
  .about-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 3fr 2fr;
    gap: var(--space-xl);
    margin-bottom: var(--space-xl);
  }
  
  .about-content h2 {
    margin-top: 0;
  }
  
  .about-image {
    border-radius: var(--radius-lg);
    overflow: hidden;
    box-shadow: var(--shadow-md);
  }
  
  .about-image img {
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
    object-fit: cover;
  }
  
  /* Vision & Mission */
  .vision-mission {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
    gap: var(--space-xl);
    margin: var(--space-xl) 0;
  }
  
  .vision, .mission {
    background-color: white;
    padding: var(--space-lg);
    border-radius: var(--radius-lg);
    box-shadow: var(--shadow-md);
  }
  
  .vision h2, .mission h2 {
    margin-top: 0;
  }
  
  /* Our Technology */
  .our-tech {
    margin: var(--space-xl) 0;
  }
  
  .tech-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fill, minmax(300px, 1fr));
    gap: var(--space-lg);
    margin-top: var(--space-lg);
  }
  
  .tech-card {
    background-color: white;
    border-radius: var(--radius-md);
    padding: var(--space-lg);
    box-shadow: var(--shadow-sm);
    transition: transform var(--transition-normal);
  }
  
  .tech-card:hover {
    transform: translateY(-5px);
    box-shadow: var(--shadow-md);
  }
  
  .tech-icon {
    color: var(--color-primary);
    margin-bottom: var(--space-md);
  }
  
  /* Team Section */
  .our-team {
    margin: var(--space-xl) 0;
  }
  
  .team-intro {
    text-align: center;
    max-width: 800px;
    margin: 0 auto var(--space-xl);
    font-size: 1.1rem;
  }
  
  .team-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fill, minmax(250px, 1fr));
    gap: var(--space-lg);
  }
  
  .team-member {
    background-color: white;
    border-radius: var(--radius-lg);
    overflow: hidden;
    box-shadow: var(--shadow-md);
    transition: transform var(--transition-normal);
    text-align: center;
  }
  
  .team-member:hover {
    transform: translateY(-5px);
    box-shadow: var(--shadow-lg);
  }
  
  .member-image {
    height: 250px;
    overflow: hidden;
  }
  
  .member-image img {
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
    object-fit: cover;
    transition: transform var(--transition-normal);
  }
  
  .team-member:hover .member-image img {
    transform: scale(1.05);
  }
  
  .team-member h3 {
    margin: var(--space-md) 0 var(--space-xs);
    padding: 0 var(--space-md);
  }
  
  .member-title {
    color: var(--color-primary);
    font-weight: 500;
    margin-bottom: var(--space-md);
    padding: 0 var(--space-md);
  }
  
  .member-bio {
    padding: 0 var(--space-md) var(--space-md);
    font-size: 0.9rem;
  }
  
  /* Impact Section */
  .our-impact {
    margin: var(--space-xl) 0;
  }
  
  .impact-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fill, minmax(300px, 1fr));
    gap: var(--space-lg);
    margin-top: var(--space-lg);
  }
  
  .impact-card {
    background-color: white;
    border-radius: var(--radius-md);
    padding: var(--space-lg);
    box-shadow: var(--shadow-sm);
    text-align: center;
    transition: transform var(--transition-normal);
  }
  
  .impact-card:hover {
    transform: translateY(-5px);
    box-shadow: var(--shadow-md);
  }
  
  .impact-icon {
    color: var(--color-primary);
    margin: 0 auto var(--space-md);
    width: 80px;
    height: 80px;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    background-color: rgba(11, 61, 145, 0.1);
    border-radius: 50%;
  }
  
  /* Media Queries */
  @media (max-width: 992px) {
    .about-grid, .vision-mission {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }
    
    .about-image {
      height: 300px;
    }
  }
  
  @media (max-width: 768px) {
    .member-image {
      height: 200px;
    }
    
    .about-hero h1 {
      font-size: 2.5rem;
    }
    
    .tagline {
      font-size: 1.2rem;
    }
  }
</style>
